WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
The contract, summarized.

2
00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:06.253
Write or approve the test before the fix, and see it fail for the right reason.

3
00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:07.301
Commit it.

4
00:00:07.581 --> 00:00:11.955
Ask for the implementation with the tests held fixed and evidence required.

5
00:00:12.235 --> 00:00:17.312
Enforce the check with a Stop hook and CI, so it doesn’t depend on the agent remembering.

6
00:00:17.592 --> 00:00:27.277
Protect existing tests with layers (instructions, deny rules, a hook, holdout tests, review rules), and review any test change before the code change.

7
00:00:27.557 --> 00:00:35.237
Raise coverage where it counts: human-named edge cases, branch coverage as a map, and properties for whole classes of inputs.

8
00:00:35.517 --> 00:00:39.144
The lab lets you watch the difference these make on the same task.
